OL,3,GNEWSAVenue admits scrapping Jewish
OL,4,Acomedian's Edinburgh Fringe show was
OL,5,Adiscrimination
OL,6,
OL,7,FA venue has accepted that it
OL,8,Fdiscriminated against a Jewish comedian
OL,9,Fwhen it cancelled his show at last
OL,10,Fyear's Edinburgh Festival Fringe over
OL,11,Fhis views about the Israel-Gaza war.
OL,13,FPhilip Simon was due to perform his
OL,14,Fstand-up show at the Banshee Labyrinth
OL,15,Fon Niddry Street, but the venue
OL,16,Fscrapped it at short notice after it
OL,17,Fcarried out "routine" checks on his
OL,18,Fsocial media.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
