OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVenue admits scrapping Jewish
OL,4,Acomedian's Edinburgh Fringe show was
OL,5,Adiscrimination
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt told industry magazine Chortle,
OL,8,Fexternal that Simon's views aligned
OL,9,Fwith "groups associated with
OL,10,Fhumanitarian violations", but the comic
OL,11,Fsaid he had been cancelled "just for
OL,12,Fbeing Jewish".
OL,14,FSimon pursued legal action and on
OL,15,FMonday his lawyer David Welsh told a
OL,16,Fcourt hearing that the venue had
OL,17,Fconceded it had acted unlawfully.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
